{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07009","headline":"送金卿归新罗 · 陶翰","name":"送金卿归新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉义朝中国，殊恩及远臣。\n乡心遥渡海，客路再经春。\n落日谁同望，孤舟独可亲。\n拂波衔木鸟，偶宿泣珠人。\n礼乐夷风变，衣冠汉制新。\n青云已干吕，知汝重来宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}